  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "He wakes up in his bed in the barracks. *I open our eyes when it\u2019s
    light out, after I closed them.* So does everyone else. Even the sleepless. 2Spade
    remembers the executions. More and more of them happen every day. Nobody can
    tell him who, or why. The ledgers have been burned and none are written anymore.
    Anyone could be killed at any second. Everyone is killed eventually. Fire and
    ash fills 2Spade\u2019s nostrils and he can\u2019t tell if he\u2019s in the crowd
    or on the blazing pyre. \r\n\r\n*Things that aren\u2019t wood can burn too.*\r\n\r\nSkin
    blisters, flesh blackens, pain is overwhelming. Horror welling up in his throat
    as the world fractures and his own consciousness burrows into himself again and
    again and again and he can feel himself lose-\r\n\r\n*Every bunk has a soldier.
    Every soldier opens its eyes when light comes.*\r\n\r\nIf everyone is being killed,
    why is nobody dead?"
